.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH devin-ssh 1  "ssh " 
.SH NAME
devin\-ssh \- SSH into a cloud Devin session\*(Aqs box
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBdevin ssh\fR [\fB\-\-gateway\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fISESSION\fR] [\fISSH_ARGS\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
SSH into a cloud Devin session\*(Aqs box
.PP
Wraps `ssh` to the Devin SSH gateway and approves the connection with your logged\-in credentials, so no browser round\-trip is needed.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-gateway\fR \fI<GATEWAY>\fR
SSH gateway host (defaults to the ssh. host of your Devin API)
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help (see a summary with \*(Aq\-h\*(Aq)
.TP
[\fISESSION\fR]
Session id or session URL (omit to pick from your cloud sessions)
.TP
[\fISSH_ARGS\fR]
Extra options passed through to ssh (e.g. `\-L 8080:localhost:8080`)
